    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "d"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "To the chief Musician for the sons of Korah, A Song upon Alamoth.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 46:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.46.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.46.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.46.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.46.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "our refuge and strength, a very present help in trouble.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.46.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.46.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 46:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore will not we fear, though the earth be removed, and though the mountains be carried into the midst of the sea;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.46.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.46.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 46:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Though",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.46.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.46.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the waters thereof roar",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.46.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.46.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.46.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.46.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "be troubled,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.46.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.46.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "though",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.46.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.46.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the mountains shake with the swelling thereof. Selah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.46.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.46.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 46:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "There is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.46.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.46.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a river, the streams whereof shall make glad the city of God, the holy",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.46.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.46.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "place",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.46.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.46.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of the tabernacles of the most High.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.46.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.46.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 46:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.46.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.46.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.46.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in the midst of her; she shall not be moved: God shall help her,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.46.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.46.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.46.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "right early.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.46.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 46:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The heathen raged, the kingdoms were moved: he uttered his voice, the earth melted.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.46.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.46.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 46:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.46.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.46.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.46.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.46.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of hosts",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.46.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.46.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.46.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.46.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with us; the God of Jacob",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.46.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.46.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.46.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.46.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "our refuge. Selah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.46.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.46.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 46:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Come, behold the works of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.46.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.46.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.46.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.46.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", what desolations he hath made in the earth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.46.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.46.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 46:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He maketh wars to cease unto the end of the earth; he breaketh the bow, and cutteth the spear in sunder; he burneth the chariot in the fire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.46.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.46.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 46:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be still, and know that I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.46.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.46.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.46.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.46.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God: I will be exalted among the heathen, I will be exalted in the earth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.46.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.46.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
